        "created_at": "2017-12-21T05:02:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've been working on an Excel spreadsheet with graphs of the Min, Mid, Max, and Min+Max probabilities for all 35 possible combinations of three dice ranging from d4 to d12.&nbsp; And I can't write code, so it was mostly brute force.&nbsp; I'm still putting the finishing touches on it, but what would be the best way to share that with everyone here?</p>",
