        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/davethegame/{size}/2051_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-21T15:24:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I mostly consulted math professors and game designers instead of running the numbers myself - however, keep in mind that a core assumption is that you will be making many Overcomes in your \"wheelhouse\" that fits with one or more of your d10s and a principle to use your Max die, and that's how you get clean successes more often. Otherwise, you'll be suceeding with twists that drive the story along or you'll use teamwork to get some bonuses first.</p>",
