        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/4bbf92/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-22T03:19:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Don't get me wrong, I like that idea. Action scenes are high stress. If you are fairly solid at doing something, being forced to do it in hurry, under stress, can force errors. So either take the twists (which can be fun), or give yourselve a boost (and risk running out of time). Good stuff.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
